        <div class="mission-grid">
          <article class="mission-card">
            <h3>Rapid Emergency Assistance</h3>
            <p>When disaster strikes, we provide shelter, food, clean water, blood support, and emergency health services within hours.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="mission-card">
            <h3>Resilience for the Long Term</h3>
            <p>Beyond immediate relief, we invest in preparedness training, infrastructure recovery, and community health to reduce future risk.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

