          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618477462146-050d2767eac4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Volunteers and aid workers coordinating emergency preparedness and community relief operations" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" />
